<title>UK: Panama soybean carrier under repair at New Orleans.</title>
<headline>Panama soybean carrier under repair at New Orleans.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Panama-flag bulk carrier Megalodoxi has offloaded its cargo of soybeans at New Orleans and is now undergoing repairs in Violet Dock, Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service said on Friday.</p>
<p>The 63,822 dwt ship had been towed in with a twisted rudder stock.</p>
</text>
